{
  "description": "Maps each human-label category to its possible values (most queries require at least 2 classifications; Awesome Flag is an exception with 1).",
  "output_root": "tables/query_galaxy_ids",
  "parquet_path": "tables/human_label_query_membership_min2.parquet",
  "parquet_key_column": "galaxyId",
  "notes": [
    "Is LSB, Morphology, Visible Nucleus, Failed Fitting, and Nucleus Confirmation require at least 2 classifications to ensure statistical significance.",
    "Awesome Flag is an exception: one vote is sufficient since it records individual classifier enthusiasm.",
    "Split queries identify tied votes among answered classifications (min 2).",
    "Not enough data queries identify galaxies where there are insufficient classifications for that category."
